&ldquo;The primary fruit of joining the holy fellowship of Satsang is to first master spiritual discretion (vivek). Until one cultivates discernment regarding when, where, with whom, and how to speak and act appropriately, myriad afflictions cannot be dispelled!&rdquo;
Infinite Peace in Discretion: Abiding in vivek holds boundless tranquility. In the life of a discerning devotee, distress can never enter. Shreehari affirmed: &ldquo;We have contemplated the entire cosmos, from the nether realms up to the primordial abode of Purush-Prakriti; there is no virtue that bestows greater serenity than spiritual discretion!&rdquo;
